domain DORMANT_V2_AUTHORING_RETIREMENT:
  description "Remove remaining executable legacy V2 candidate generation and derived update bodies."
evidence OWNER:
  "Accepted ADR0043 and current owner goal require complete ordinary V2 character create/update retirement, preserving display and explicit V3 migration. Necessary local corrections, originpush/CI, imagebuild and deployments authorized."
evidence REVIEW:
  "Independent writer audit finds no HTTP/queued V2 write bypass, but buildCharacterGenerationCandidate remains exported and calls V2 providers to produce a V2 candidate. Three exported portrait/toggle/restore methods still query V2 state and construct derived V2 envelopes before the central V3 guard rejects persistence. They have no current product route call site; handlers already reject. Old success tests are historical authority and not current accepted V2-write expectations."
premise SCOPE:
  "Retire these four old runtime operations at their callable boundary with deterministic unavailable errors before provider/DB work. Remove their unused private V2 writer helpers and provider-generation body, including the obsolete contract-related cast inside the removed selecthelper. Preserve public signatures for archived test compilation, V2 immutable readers, deterministic historical-source import representation, explicit V3 migration/activation and separate battle accounting. Do not rewrite unrelated migration/import/isolated historical smoke harnesses or revive their V2 product-writer behavior."
decision IMPLEMENT based_on OWNER, REVIEW, SCOPE:
  "Replace old provider builder body with LEGACY_CHARACTER_AUTHORING_RETIRED rejection; replace three old repository mutation bodies with CHARACTER_UPDATE_UNAVAILABLE rejection. Add current authority-bound behavioral regression calling each directly (missing ID must still get retired error), checking no provider/status work or row/generation/attempt changes. Keep historicalread/V3positive tests. Run full selectedtests/typecheck/static, refresh changed testSeal preserving Causes, freeze/pushCI/build once. Supersede the09e9 publiccandidate before any publicwrite; deploy only newverifiedsource with matchingfrontend. No placeholder delivered: these functions intentionally decline retired capabilities already disallowed by accepted ownerbehavior."
